Okay, I've made a slight alteration. One of my patch's minor features
is assigning 'demon' status to some of the 'i's - for example, manes
and lemures. I wasn't sure about imps and quasits, though, as they
leave edible corpses.

But, after referring to some D&D related pages, I've found that they're
counted as being demons as well. So I added them.

Interesting, how of all the D&D demons only imps and quasits leave
corpses.



